WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.000
Start from what your report already shows.
All inputs in this video are examples.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The chain lights up only where
something was measured.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Here a business metric is tracked, but nothing
selected links it to the training.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Open any link to see what it can’t establish
and a suggested next step.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Tick what you actually measured, such as
a skill check or observed use on the job.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Check the workplace. A “No” on manager support
marks a reported barrier to verify.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Leave with a brief your leaders can act on,
and copy it with its example label.
